{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2023-01-09 16:30:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. SCHEDULES DATE FOR RELEASE OF FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2022 RESULTS', 'text': "ATLANTA , JAN. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE: ROL), A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL RELEASE ITS UNAUDITED FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE PERIOD ENDED DECEMBER 31, 2022 AFTER THE MARKET CLOSES ON WEDNESDAY, FEBRUARY 15, 2023.\xa0 IN CONJUNCTION WITH ITS RELEASE, THE COMPANY WILL HOST A CONFERENCE CALL TO REVIEW THE COMPANY'S FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS BEFORE THE MARKET OPENS ON THURSDAY, FEBRUARY 16, 2023 AT 8:30 A.M."}{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2023-01-09 00:01:00', 'title': "THE WINDY CITY CAN'T BLOW BED BUGS AWAY: CHICAGO RANKS #1 FOR THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR ON ORKIN'S BED BUG CITIES LIST", 'text': "CONSIDER THESE BED BUG PREVENTION TIPS AS YOU SHOP FOR 2023 TRAVEL ATLANTA , JAN. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE WINDY CITY IS SETTLING IN AS THE #1 CITY ON ORKIN'S TOP 50 BED BUG CITIES LIST FOR THE THIRD YEAR IN A ROW. CHICAGO , NEW YORK \xa0AND PHILADELPHIA \xa0HOLD ONTO THE TOP THREE SPOTS, RANKING FIRST, SECOND AND THIRD, RESPECTIVELY."}{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2023-01-07 17:28:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF ROLLINS, INC. - ROL', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 7, 2023) - POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF ROLLINS, INC. ("ROLLINS" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: ROL). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S. WILLOUGHBY AT NEWACTION@POMLAW.COM OR 888-476-6529, EXT. 7980.THE INVESTIGATION CONCERNS WHETHER ROLLINS AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS AND/OR DIRECTORS HAVE ENGAGED IN SECURITIES FRAUD OR OTHER UNLAWFUL BUSINESS PRACTICES.'}